{"id": "DdQF09DPR04", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"GOOGLE\" to get this Free Google Maps Scraper AI Tool. \n\nThis free AI tool lets you scrape unlimited local leads without paying for anything.\n\nIt's called Google Maps Scraper Kit.\n\nIt's a free and open source scraper that runs on your own computer.\n\nWith Claude automating the whole thing for you.\n\nYou just tell it the city and the type of business you want to target.\n\nAnd it comes back with a clean list of everything.\n\nTheir name, phone, email, website, and address.\n\nPlus it even pulls their social media accounts straight from their website.\n\nSo you can reach them there too.\n\nThink of it like sending an assistant out to walk every street in a city and write down every business detail for you.\n\nNo manual searching, no copy pasting from map listings one at a time.\n\nNo paying for a lead gen service that charges you per contact.\n\nThis works for cold outreach, local SEO research, or just building a database of businesses in any area you want to target.\n\nRun it for one city or a hundred, the process stays exactly the same either way.\n\n#googlemapscraper #githubrepo #claudeai #webscraping ", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1789353883, "like_count": 3387, "comment_count": 5426, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1082476884752274a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 59.962, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNq1k1_S9Wu3phY-L80_4f30EyNDLaEpkUqcGOLwGE-1CZGGytxMjf-rb74FrbENo6sctOSKjU1zV2v6Pe7Pp0ZrOXMWHWjHVZVe0g.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adq3lOm5iU7yyYl6phjjycsIAy-u7eYYyby6XSE1H61X9zq4S_fvkGaUHGgqXU7auZs&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=-DSUoqM447QQ7kNvwF9efqj&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=g93lguY2VaYymwNcw-DK